sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant O as Order Service
    participant B as Message Broker
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant I as Inventory Service
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant G as Gateway Financeiro

    C->>O: POST /orders + Idempotency-Key
    O->>O: Grava order=PENDING + Outbox (transação local)
    O-->>B: OrderCreated (outbox relay)
    B-->>S: OrderCreated
    S->>S: Persiste Saga=RESERVING_STOCK
    S-->>B: ReserveStock(sagaId, commandId)
    B-->>I: ReserveStock
    I->>I: Reserva estoque atomicamente (idempotente + TTL)
    I-->>B: StockReserved(reservationId)
    B-->>S: StockReserved
    S->>S: Persiste Saga=PROCESSING_PAYMENT
    S-->>B: ProcessPayment(paymentKey estável)
    B-->>P: ProcessPayment
    P->>G: Processa pagamento (mesma chave idempotente)
    G-->>P: Pagamento aprovado
    P-->>B: PaymentSucceeded(paymentId)
    B-->>S: PaymentSucceeded
    S->>S: Persiste Saga=CONFIRMING_ORDER
    S-->>B: ConfirmOrder(orderId)
    B-->>O: ConfirmOrder
    O->>O: Transição PENDING -> CONFIRMED
    O-->>B: OrderConfirmed
    B-->>S: OrderConfirmed
    S->>S: Persiste Saga=COMPLETED
    O-->>C: Status consultável: CONFIRMED (API pode retornar 202 inicialmente)
